      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. In the morning, a transfer will be made to the El Dorado International Airport to take the scheduled charter flight (Included), the appointment time at the airport is at 05:00 am, flight duration is approximately 1 hour. Arrival at the municipality of La Macarena and induction talk by the municipal authorities, we will transfer to the assigned accommodation, a room will be given to change clothes and store luggage; An alternative place to Caño Cristales will be visited according to the indications and assigned by the environmental authorities.\n\n• Alternate place 1 - Caño Cristalitos and viewpoint\n\n• Alternate place 2 - Caño Piedra\n\n• Alternate place 3 - Rio Bajo Lozada\n\nLunch (included) will be taken during the assigned activity.\n\nReturn to the hotel to check in (3:00 p.m.), dinner (included). Accommodation\n\nNote: It is essential that this Tour start on Thursdays or Saturdays, by air operation between connections"
    },
